  "bio": "Diego Castro, based in Campo Grande, Brazil, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in intricate fineline, elegant floral designs, and detailed dotwork. Renowned for maintaining a pristine studio at Estudio Colibri Tattoo, cleanliness is at the heart of Castro's practice, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for each client looking to bring their artistic vision to life. Those seeking a tattoo artist who prioritizes a clean workspace need look no further than Diego's professional and meticulous setup.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Campo Grande, Mato Grosso Do Sul, Brazil"
